{
  "key": 54371,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_PsstOverHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Psst! Here.\n",
        "Over here.\r",
        "This gathering of the Team\n",
        "Galactic... What is the meaning of\r",
        "it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_TheWorldMustChange",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Fellow members of Team\n",
        "Galactic! Hear me!\r",
        "My name, as I appear to you today,\n",
        "is Cyrus.\r",
        "This world is a crude one. We\n",
        "drift listlessly through it.\r",
        "Unable to achieve a true purpose.\n",
        "Arceus abandoned us long ago and\r",
        "in its absence a hole was left.\n",
        "One that we fill with meaningless\r",
        "battles and struggles against one\n",
        "another. This world is imperfect\r",
        "because the gods let it be so. We\n",
        "are not gods... but I have\r",
        "acquired the knowledge and\n",
        "willpower to create a new world.\r",
        "One of order and peace, where\n",
        "there will be no fighting. Among\r",
        "trainers nor Pokémon. A pure world\n",
        "of peace. The Buddhists might call\r",
        "it Nirvana."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_WeWillChangeIt",
      "en_US": [
        "We team Galactic, will usher in a\n",
        "new glorious age of peace. We will\r",
        "chain the cruel gods to our will\n",
        "and use their power to unleash a\r",
        "new age of tranquility."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_LetThereBeGlory",
      "en_US": [
        "Understand it, fellow members!\r",
        "My long-held dreamworld is on the\n",
        "verge of becoming reality.\r",
        "All those headed to Mt. Coronet,\n",
        "and those who remain here...\r",
        "Though our missions may differ,\n",
        "our hearts beat as one.\r",
        "Let there be glory for Team\n",
        "Galactic!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_GruntsWroooar",
      "en_US": "Grunts: WROOOAR!!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_CyrusIsTheGreatest",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt: Master Cyrus is the\n",
        "greatest!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_QuiteThePerformance",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: ...Whew.\r",
        "So, that was Cyrus, the boss of\n",
        "the Team Galactic.\r",
        "Quite the performance, no?\n",
        "Mesmerizing for one only 27 years\r",
        "old.\r",
        "...But to make a world for Team\n",
        "Galactic and none other?\r",
        "It is preposterous. So much so\n",
        "that it makes my head spin.\r",
        "A new world? What is that?\n",
        "And what is this incomplete world?\r",
        "Very well. To investigate such\n",
        "matters is the job of the\r",
        "International Police.\r",
        "Of which I am a member in good\n",
        "stead. And it is my job,\r",
        "therefore.\r",
        "We shall part ways here.\n",
        "Take extra care, my friend!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQHall_Text_Dummy7",
      "garbage": 34
    }
  ]
}
